// #64, #78: data that arrives after close() resets the connection (RFC 1122
// §4.2.2.13, Linux tcp_rcv_state_process: TCPAbortOnData).
0      connect 192.0.2.2:80
+0     > S 0:0(0) <mss 1460,sackOK,nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 0,nop,wscale 8,eol>
+0.01  < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535

+0     close
+0     > F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0.01  < P. 1:101(100) ack 2 win 4000
+0     > R 2:2(0)
+0     state GONE
